---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Financial & Advertising Disclaimer | TOOLBOXS"
  description="Financial and affiliate advertising disclaimers for TOOLBOXS."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Disclaimer', url: '/disclaimer' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="space-y-3 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/70 border border-emerald-200/80 dark:border-emerald-800/80 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 shadow-xs">
        <span>⚖️ Disclaimer</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Financial & Advertising Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: Fiscal Year 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Not Certified Financial Advice</h2>
      <p>
        The calculations, salary estimations, tax brackets, mortgage amortization tables, and FIRE retirement projections displayed on TOOLBOXS are generated for illustrative and personal budgeting scenarios. Laws, tax codes, and exemptions vary across individual circumstances. You should always consult with a licensed CPA, tax attorney, or certified financial planner before taking financial actions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        TOOLBOXS participates in financial affiliate programs. We may earn a commission or referral fee when you click links or open accounts with affiliate partner platforms (such as high-yield savings accounts, tax software, or mortgage lenders) at no extra cost to you.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
